    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account.\n\nThis is a super detached property in a prime location on Channel Road in Rush. This expansive 4 bedroomed detached home offers generous living spaces throughout, along with a large, private driveway that can accommodate multiple vehicles. The property features two side entrances that lead to a walled, south facing rear garden complete with a spacious workshop. \n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises entrance hall, large living room, bedroom 1, family bathroom, bedroom 2, spacious kitchen/dining area with utility room. Upstairs there are two very spacious bedrooms both having the benefit of ensuite bathrooms. \n\nThe property's location on Channel Road is exceptional as it is within walking distance of Rush Main Street and all its amenities. Additionally, it is just a few minutes' walk to the beautiful South Beach, making it an ideal family setting.\n\nChannel Road is also only minutes away from Rush golf club. Rush is a prosperous village offering every convenience on your doorstep, train station, shops, restaurants, traditional pubs, schools, theatre, golf not to forget the various water and beach activities.\n\nRush/Lusk train station is a five-minute drive away, the M1 is a c.15 minutes' drive and the M50 and Dublin Airport and Swords are a 20-25 minutes' drive. Rush also has a very good bus service to the city centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.51m x 4.17m\nWith tiled flooring, recessed lighting.\n\nReception Hall - 5.15m x 7.17m\nWith tiled flooring, recessed lighting.\n\nLiving Room - 7.40m x 4.91m\nWith carpet flooring, recessed lighting, large stove, box bay window.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.76m x 3.81m\nWith built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2/ Office - 2.87m x 4.31m\nWith built in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 3.26m x 2.79m\nFully tiled wall to floor, W.C, W.H.B, separate shower and bath.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 6.38m x 4.90m\nWith tiled flooring, recessed lighting, integrated oven & hob, tiled splash back, an abundance of fitted kitchen units, door to utility room, door to rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 2.71m x 1.85m\nWith tiled flooring\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding - 3.87m x 3.72m\nWith carpet flooring, Velux windows\n\nPrimary Bedroom (3) - 4.14m x 6.63m\nVery generous double bedroom with carpet flooring and bank of built in wardrobes, door to en-suite.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.48m x 1.82m\nFully tiled wall to floor, W.C. W.H.B., double shower unit, Velux window.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.15m x 4.42m\nWith carpet flooring, built in wardrobe, door to ensuite.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.48m x 1.79m\nTiled wall to floor, W.C. W.H.B and shower\n\nOutside - \nFront garden has very spacious cobble lock driveway with off street parking for multiple vehicles, two side entrances leading to sunny walled rear garden which is south facing. Rear garden is of low maintenance design with patio area and stoned garden area with large workshop with power.\n\n"
      },
      {
